#: ../../../source/preface.md:1
msgid "写在前面：关于深度学习"
msgstr "Preface: About Deep Learning"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:3
msgid "深度学习是什么"
msgstr "What is deep learning?"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:5
msgid "深度学习是机器学习的一个分支，而机器学习又是人工智能（AI）的一部分。可以这样理解它们的关系："
msgstr "Deep learning is a branch of machine learning, and machine learning is part of artificial intelligence (AI). Their relationship can be understood as follows:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:7
msgid "**人工智能**：让机器展现出需要人类智能才能完成的能力（如识别图像、理解语言）"
msgstr "**Artificial Intelligence**: Enabling machines to demonstrate capabilities that require human intelligence (such as recognizing images or understanding language)"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:8
msgid "**机器学习**：让机器从数据中自动学习规律，而不是通过显式编程"
msgstr "**Machine Learning**: Enabling machines to automatically learn patterns from data rather than being explicitly programmed"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:9
msgid "**深度学习**：使用多层神经网络进行机器学习的方法"
msgstr "**Deep Learning**: A method of machine learning that uses multi-layer neural networks"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:21
msgid "深度学习之所以\"深\"，是因为它的网络结构有很多层。每一层都会从数据中提取不同层次的特征：浅层识别边缘和纹理，深层识别物体部件和语义概念。这种层次化的特征提取，让深度学习在图像、语音、文本等领域取得了突破性进展。"
msgstr "Deep learning is \"deep\" because its network architecture has many layers. Each layer extracts features at a different level: shallow layers detect edges and textures, while deeper layers identify object parts and semantic concepts. This hierarchical feature extraction has driven breakthroughs in image, speech, and text applications."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:23
msgid "黑盒与炼丹"
msgstr "Black boxes and alchemy"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:25
msgid "为什么叫炼丹"
msgstr "Why call it alchemy?"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:27
msgid "老一代深度学习研究者常自嘲说自己在\"炼丹\"。这个说法虽然调侃，但确实抓住了深度学习的某些特点："
msgstr "The older generation of deep learning researchers often jokingly described their work as \"alchemy.\" Though self-deprecating, this phrase accurately captures certain characteristics of deep learning:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:29
msgid "**配方复杂**：学习率、批大小、网络结构、正则化参数...每个选择都可能影响结果"
msgstr "**Complex recipes**: Learning rates, batch sizes, network architectures, regularization parameters... every choice can affect the outcome"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:30
msgid "**过程不可控**：同样的代码跑两次，结果可能略有不同（随机初始化、数据打乱）"
msgstr "**Uncontrollable process**: Running the exact same code twice can yield slightly different results (due to random initialization and data shuffling)"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:31
msgid "**结果难预测**：理论上合理的改动，实践中可能完全无效甚至适得其反"
msgstr "**Unpredictable results**: Modifications that seem theoretically sound might prove useless or even counterproductive in practice"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:32
msgid "**经验重于理论**：很多时候靠的是\"试试就知道\"，而不是严密的数学推导"
msgstr "**Experience over theory**: Success often relies on \"trial and error\" rather than rigorous mathematical derivations"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:34
msgid "但炼丹也有科学方法"
msgstr "Alchemy can still be scientific"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:36
msgid "虽然我们自嘲炼丹，但这并不意味着深度学习完全是玄学。好的\"炼丹师\"会："
msgstr "Although we joke about alchemy, this does not mean deep learning is pure mysticism. A good \"alchemist\" will:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:38
msgid "**做对照实验**：改变一个变量，保持其他不变，观察影响"
msgstr "**Conduct controlled experiments**: Change one variable while keeping others constant to observe the impact"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:39
msgid "**记录实验日志**：详细记录每次实验的配置和结果，建立可复现性"
msgstr "**Keep experiment logs**: Record configurations and results for every run to establish reproducibility"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:40
msgid "**理解原理**：知道为什么要用某个技巧（如BatchNorm是为了解决内部协变量偏移）"
msgstr "**Understand underlying principles**: Know why a technique works (e.g., BatchNorm aims to mitigate internal covariate shift)"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:41
msgid "**系统性调参**：不是随机尝试，而是按重要性排序（学习率 > 网络结构 > 优化器 > ...）"
msgstr "**Tune hyperparameters systematically**: Instead of random trial and error, prioritize by importance (learning rate > network architecture > optimizer > ...)"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:43
msgid "黑盒不等于不可理解"
msgstr "A black box is not necessarily incomprehensible"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:45
msgid "深度学习模型常被批评为\"黑盒\"——输入进去，输出出来，中间发生了什么不知道。但实际上，我们有越来越多的工具来理解模型："
msgstr "Deep learning models are often criticized as \"black boxes\"—inputs go in, outputs come out, with little transparency about what happens in between. In reality, however, we have an expanding set of tools to interpret models:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:47
msgid "**特征可视化**：看卷积层在关注图像的哪些部分"
msgstr "**Feature visualization**: Inspect which parts of an image the convolutional layers focus on"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:48
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**注意力热图**：看Transformer在处理文本时关注了哪些词（详见 {ref}`transformer`）"
msgstr "**Attention heatmaps**: See which words Transformers attend to when processing text (see {ref}`transformer` for details)"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:49
msgid "**消融实验**：去掉某个模块，看性能下降多少，从而判断其重要性"
msgstr "**Ablation experiments**: Remove a specific component to see how much performance drops, gauging its importance"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:50
msgid "**对抗样本分析**：通过构造特殊输入，理解模型的决策边界"
msgstr "**Adversarial example analysis**: Construct targeted inputs to probe and understand the model's decision boundaries"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:52
msgid "这些方法让我们能够\"打开\"黑盒，虽然不能完全理解每一个细节，但至少知道模型在做决策时考虑了哪些因素。"
msgstr "These methods allow us to \"open\" the black box. While we may not grasp every single detail, we can at least understand which factors influence the model's decisions."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:54
msgid "你需要的心态"
msgstr "The mindset you need"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:56
msgid "理论与实践并重"
msgstr "Balance theory and practice"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:58
msgid "深度学习是一个理论与实践紧密结合的领域。只懂理论不会写代码，你无法验证想法；只写代码不懂理论，你只能在已知范围内打转。"
msgstr "Deep learning is a field where theory and practice are tightly coupled. If you only know theory without coding skills, you cannot validate your ideas; if you only write code without understanding theory, you will be stuck wandering in circles."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:60
msgid "建议的学习方式是："
msgstr "The recommended learning approach is:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:62
msgid "**先理解原理**：知道某个技术为什么有效（如：Dropout是集成学习的近似）"
msgstr "**Understand principles first**: Know why a technique works (e.g., Dropout is an approximation of ensemble learning)"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:63
msgid "**再动手实现**：用自己的代码复现一遍，加深理解"
msgstr "**Implement hands-on second**: Reproduce it with your own code to deepen your understanding"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:64
msgid "**最后做实验**：在自己的数据集上验证，观察实际效果"
msgstr "**Experiment last**: Validate on your own datasets and observe the actual results"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:66
msgid "培养直觉"
msgstr "Build intuition"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:68
msgid "在深度学习领域，有时候**直觉比公式更重要**。当你看到一个新的架构时，能够凭直觉判断\"这个设计会有效吗\"比能够推导反向传播公式更有价值。"
msgstr "In deep learning, **intuition is sometimes more important than formulas**. When you see a new architecture, being able to intuitively judge \"will this design work?\" is often more valuable than deriving backpropagation formulas."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:70
msgid "培养直觉的方法："
msgstr "Ways to build intuition:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:72
msgid "**多看架构**：了解经典网络的设计思路和演进历程"
msgstr "**Study many architectures**: Learn the design philosophies and evolution of classic networks"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:73
msgid "**多做实验**：亲手调参，感受不同选择的影响"
msgstr "**Run many experiments**: Tune hyperparameters yourself to feel the impact of different choices"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:74
msgid "**多思考\"为什么\"**：不是记住\"这样做有效\"，而是理解\"为什么有效\""
msgstr "**Ask \"why\" often**: Instead of just remembering \"this works,\" understand *why* it works"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:76
msgid "记住，深度学习领域很多\"真理\"都是暂时的。五年前的最佳实践，今天可能已经被淘汰。只有培养出好的直觉，才能在这个快速变化的领域保持竞争力。"
msgstr "Remember, many \"truths\" in deep learning are temporary. Best practices from five years ago might be obsolete today. Only by cultivating good intuition can you stay competitive in this fast-changing field."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:78
msgid "保持怀疑精神"
msgstr "Stay skeptical"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:80
msgid "深度学习领域充斥着各种说法："
msgstr "The deep learning community is filled with claims:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:82
msgid "\"这个架构在ImageNet上达到了SOTA\""
msgstr "\"This architecture achieved SOTA on ImageNet\""

#: ../../../source/preface.md:83
msgid "\"我们的方法比基线提高了5%\""
msgstr "\"Our method improved over the baseline by 5%\""

#: ../../../source/preface.md:84
msgid "\"这个技巧对所有任务都有效\""
msgstr "\"This trick works for all tasks\""

#: ../../../source/preface.md:86
msgid "作为学习者，你需要保持怀疑："
msgstr "As a learner, you need to stay skeptical:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:88
msgid "**质疑结果**：5%的提升是统计显著的吗？测试集有没有泄露？"
msgstr "**Question results**: Is the 5% gain statistically significant? Was there test-set leakage?"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:89
msgid "**质疑结论**：在一个数据集上的有效，能推广到其他数据集吗？"
msgstr "**Question conclusions**: Does what worked on one dataset generalize to others?"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:90
msgid "**质疑论文**：作者有没有隐藏负面结果？对比的基线是不是太弱？"
msgstr "**Question papers**: Did the authors hide negative results? Was the baseline too weak?"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:91
msgid "**质疑权威**：即使是大佬说的，也要有独立判断"
msgstr "**Question authority**: Even if stated by leading experts, maintain independent judgment"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:93
msgid "怀疑精神不是为了抬杠，而是为了建立真正可靠的知识。当你能够分辨哪些是可靠的结论、哪些是过度宣传时，你就成为了合格的深度学习从业者。"
msgstr "Skepticism is not about being argumentative; it is about building truly reliable knowledge. When you can distinguish between dependable conclusions and overhyped claims, you become a qualified deep learning practitioner."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:95
msgid "耐心与迭代"
msgstr "Patience and iteration"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:97
msgid "最后，学习深度学习需要耐心。不要指望看一遍材料就能完全理解，也不要因为第一次实验失败就气馁。"
msgstr "Finally, learning deep learning requires patience. Don't expect to fully grasp everything on the first read, and don't be discouraged if your first experiment fails."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:99
msgid "**反复阅读**：第一遍可能只看懂30%，第二遍60%，第三遍90%"
msgstr "**Re-read repeatedly**: You might understand 30% on the first pass, 60% on the second, and 90% on the third"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:100
msgid "**多次实验**：调参很少一次成功，记录每次结果，逐步逼近最优"
msgstr "**Experiment repeatedly**: Hyperparameter tuning rarely succeeds on the first try; log every result and gradually approach the optimum"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:101
msgid "**接受失败**：很多想法最终证明是无效的，但这本身就是学习过程"
msgstr "**Accept failure**: Many ideas ultimately prove ineffective, but that is an integral part of the learning process"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:103
msgid "记住，即使是顶级研究者，大部分想法也是失败的。区别在于，他们能够从失败中提取信息，快速迭代到下一个想法。"
msgstr "Remember that even top researchers see most of their ideas fail. The difference is that they extract insights from failure and iterate quickly to the next idea."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:105
msgid "如何使用这份材料"
msgstr "How to use these materials"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:107
msgid "这份材料的设计遵循了上述学习理念："
msgstr "The design of these materials follows the learning philosophy outlined above:"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:109
msgid "**从直觉出发**：每个概念都先建立直觉理解，再深入数学细节"
msgstr "**Start from intuition**: Establish intuitive understanding for every concept before diving into mathematical details"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:110
msgid "**理论与实践结合**：每个理论点都有对应的代码实现和实验"
msgstr "**Combine theory with practice**: Every theoretical point is paired with code implementation and experiments"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:111
msgid "**强调对比和怀疑**：鼓励你质疑、实验、形成自己的判断"
msgstr "**Emphasize comparison and skepticism**: Encourage you to question, experiment, and form your own judgment"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:112
msgid "**渐进式深入**：从基础概念逐步过渡到前沿技术"
msgstr "**Progressive depth**: Transition step-by-step from foundational concepts to cutting-edge techniques"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:114
msgid "建议的学习方式是：**先通读建立整体认知，再精读理解细节，最后动手实验验证**。遇到不懂的地方，可以暂时跳过，很多时候后面的内容会帮助理解前面的概念。"
msgstr "The recommended study strategy is: **read through first to build a macro view, read carefully to grasp details, and validate with hands-on experiments**. If you encounter tricky spots, feel free to skip them temporarily—later sections often help clarify earlier concepts."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:116
msgid "与鱼书配合阅读"
msgstr "Reading alongside the \"Fish Book\""

#: ../../../source/preface.md:118
msgid "如果你正在读斋藤康毅的《深度学习入门：基于Python的理论与实现》（俗称\"鱼书\"），那么恭喜你——你手里拿的是深度学习领域口碑最好的入门书之一。本书和鱼书不是替代关系，而是**互补关系**。"
msgstr "If you are reading Koki Saito's *Deep Learning from Scratch: Building with Python from First Principles* (commonly known as the \"Fish Book\"), congratulations—you hold one of the most acclaimed introductory books in deep learning. These course materials do not replace the Fish Book; they are **complementary**."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:120
msgid "鱼书讲什么"
msgstr "What the Fish Book covers"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:122
msgid "鱼书共8章，从Python基础出发，**不依赖任何外部库**，只用NumPy从零开始手写："
msgstr "The Fish Book consists of 8 chapters, starting from Python basics and building everything from scratch using only NumPy **without external libraries**:"

