msgstr "Deep Learning"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "深层网络、历史（AlexNet/VGG/ResNet）、应用"
msgstr "Deep networks, history (AlexNet/VGG/ResNet), applications"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:135
msgid "鱼书的核心理念是：**\"只有做出来才能真正理解\"**。它强迫你亲手写每一行代码，让你明白PyTorch里那些`.backward()`、`nn.Conv2d`背后到底发生了什么。"
msgstr "The core philosophy of the Fish Book is: **\"You only truly understand what you build yourself.\"** It forces you to write every line of code by hand, so you know exactly what is happening under the hood when PyTorch runs `.backward()` or `nn.Conv2d`."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:137
msgid ""
"**鱼书第1~2章与本材料的衔接**：鱼书第1章（Python/NumPy）和第2章（感知机）非常基础。本材料默认读者**已经会用Python和NumPy**，所以如果你"
" Python 完全不熟，建议先快速过一遍鱼书第1章；如果你已经能熟练写 NumPy 数组操作，这两章可以跳过，直接从第3章开始配着本材料读。"
msgstr ""
"**Connecting Fish Book Ch. 1–2 with these materials**: Fish Book Chapter 1 (Python/NumPy) and Chapter 2 (Perceptrons) are very basic. These materials assume readers **already know Python and NumPy**. If you are unfamiliar with Python, we suggest skimming Chapter 1 of the Fish Book first; if you are already comfortable with NumPy array operations, you can skip Chapters 1–2 and read starting from Chapter 3 alongside our course materials."

#: ../../../source/preface.md:139
msgid "怎么配合读"
msgstr "How to read them together"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "场景"
msgstr "Scenario"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "建议"
msgstr "Recommendation"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "你**完全零基础**"
msgstr "You are a **complete beginner**"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "先读鱼书第1~3章，再读本材料的数学基础和神经网络基础"
msgstr "Read Fish Book Ch. 1–3 first, then read our Math Fundamentals and Neural Network basics"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "你**懂Python但不懂反向传播**"
msgstr "You **know Python but not backpropagation**"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid "鱼书第5章（计算图）+ 本材料{doc}`数学基础 <math-fundamentals/index>`，两手抓"
msgstr "Combine Fish Book Ch. 5 (Computational Graphs) with our {doc}`Math Fundamentals <math-fundamentals/index>`"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "你**会跑PyTorch但不懂原理**"
msgstr "You **can run PyTorch but don't understand the principles**"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "鱼书第4~6章（梯度下降、更新技巧）+ 本材料对应理论，填坑"
msgstr "Fish Book Ch. 4–6 (gradient descent, update tricks) + matching theory in our materials to fill the gaps"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "你**想参加比赛/做项目**"
msgstr "You **want to enter competitions or build projects**"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "鱼书第7章（CNN手写实现）+ 本材料CNN消融研究+迁移学习，实战起飞"
msgstr "Fish Book Ch. 7 (handwritten CNN implementation) + our CNN Ablation Study and Transfer Learning for practical acceleration"

#: ../../../source/preface.md:11
msgid "你**卡在某个概念**"
msgstr "You are **stuck on a specific concept**"

